From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tinycast Recipe <recipe@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:45:24 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] tinycast-space 0007: confetti
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Confetti as a system action and as `raycast://confetti`, drawn by the new `ConfettiOverlay.swift` with `CAEmitterLayer` (plus the undocumented `plane` particle type and `drag`/`wave` behaviours the effect needs, each applied defensively). Tunable live through `confetti.*` defaults. With Reduce motion on nothing animates: a burst on screen closes and a 🎉 HUD shows instead, for the command and the link alike (as [mSarheed/pipcast](https://github.com/mSarheed/pipcast/commit/9e8dd60a) does).

Origin: tinycast-space 0007-confetti.patch @ ffccfc3
